<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TEREX CORP STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TEREX CORP STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Terex Corp as buy.</p>
<p>-- said Terex's &quot;skillfull management team has demonstrated an ability to significantly enhance shareholder value in a less than ideal industry environment.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said believes further upside is available, &quot;especially if Terex soon approaches a targeted 10 percent operating margin.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Terex, which makes earthmoving, construction and heavy equipment, gained 3/4 to 22-1/4.</p>
</text>
